      "id": "phrase-antes-conocido-como",
      "kind": "phrase",
      "promptEs": "antes conocido/a como + nombre",
      "questionEn": "How do you say that a person, company, or thing used to be known by another name?",
      "answerEn": "Use antes, then conocido or conocida to match the thing, then como and the former name.",
      "noteEn": "Antes means ‘formerly’ here. Conocido changes to conocida, conocidos, or conocidas to match what is being described; como introduces the old name. The plus sign in the prompt means that the former name comes next.",
      "example": { "es": "La empresa antes conocida como Sol cambió de nombre.", "en": "The company formerly known as Sol changed its name." },
      "tags": ["phrase", "names", "agreement", "B1"]
